      "filePath": "/tmp/iss-ue-ca-plugin/claude/uac/ue-ca/skills/retrieving-context/references/implementation_docs/manager.md",
      "content": "# ExtensionManager\n\n## Overview\n\nExtensionManager is a singleton that manages extension state: error collection, partial results, and cancellation status.\n\n## Key Features\n\n### 1. Error Collection\n\n**Strategic error collection** - Collect multiple errors when continuing provides value:\n\n```python\n# In validation - collect ALL errors before raising\nexc = DataValidationError(\"Port must be 1-65535\")\nextension_manager.add_error(exc, field=\"port\", value=99999)\n\nif extension_manager.has_errors():\n    raise DataValidationError(f\"{extension_manager.error_count()} errors\")\n```\n\n**Fail fast** - Raise immediately on blocking errors:\n\n```python\n# In actions - fail fast on critical errors\ntry:\n    connect()\nexcept Exception as e:\n    exc = ServiceConnectionError(\"Connection failed\")\n    extension_manager.add_error(exc)\n    raise exc\n```\n\n### 2. Partial Results\n\nStore what was accomplished before error occurred:\n\n```python\n# Process items, store partial results\nextension_manager.set_result({\n    \"processed_count\": 25,\n    \"total_count\": 100,\n    \"failed_items\": [\"item-26\"]\n})\nraise ExecutionError(\"Batch processing failed\")\n```\n\nAccess in build_result:\n\n```python\nreturn self.build_result(\n    input_fields=input_data,\n    result=extension_manager.result,\n    errors=extension_manager.to_array(),\n    exit_code=1\n)\n```\n\n### 3. Cancellation Flag\n\n**Set in extension_cancel():**\n\n```python\ndef extension_cancel(self):\n    extension_manager.set_cancelled()\n```\n\n**Check in actions:**\n\n```python\nfor item in items:\n    if extension_manager.is_cancelled():\n        raise OperationCancelledError(\"User cancelled\")\n    process(item)\n```\n\n## Methods\n\n**`clear()`** - Reset all state (call at extension start)\n\n**`add_error(exception, **kwargs)`** - Add error with context\n\n**`set_result(result)`** - Store partial result data\n\n**`has_errors()`** - Check if any errors collected\n\n**`error_count()`** - Get count of errors\n\n**`to_array()`** - Get errors as list for unv_output\n\n**`result`** - Property to get result data\n\n**`errors`** - Property to get errors list\n\n**`set_cancelled()`** - Set cancellation flag\n\n**`is_cancelled()`** - Check if cancelled\n\n**`cancelled`** - Property for cancellation status\n\n## Singleton Pattern\n\nExtensionManager uses singleton pattern - same instance accessed everywhere:\n\n```python\nfrom manager import ExtensionManager\nextension_manager = ExtensionManager()  # Same instance\n```\n\nSee src/manager.py for full implementation.",
